{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-categorical-dirac-operator-unique","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:categorical-dirac-operator-unique","kind":"proposition","title":"Uniqueness of the categorical Dirac operator","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-categorical-dirac-operator-exists"],"proofs":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prf-categorical-dirac-operator-unique"],"tags":["uniqueness","dirac-operator"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.CategoricalDirac.unique","text":"categorical-dirac-operator-unique.md","leanSource":"categorical-dirac-operator-unique.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:categorical-dirac-operator-unique\"></a><p>Given fixed <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\nabla</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>, and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\xi</code>, the categorical Dirac operator <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{D}_\\nabla = q^{-1} \\nabla + (1 - q^{-1}) \\iota_\\xi \\nabla</code> is uniquely determined by the formula. Any morphism <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A \\to \\Omega^1(A)</code> that decomposes as <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\alpha \\nabla + \\beta \\iota_\\xi \\nabla</code> with <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\alpha = q^{-1}</code> and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\beta = 1 - q^{-1}</code> equals <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{D}_\\nabla</code>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-dirac-operator-unique.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"4.12.3","page":"b/prop-categorical-dirac-operator-unique","qa":{"counts":{"pass":91,"fail":1,"warn":1,"na":11,"unknown":0,"stale":70},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":1}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.CategoricalDirac.unique","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-dirac-operator-unique.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
